1	//! `mail-core`: headless fixture mail core for vertical slice 01.
2	//!
3	//! Owns the frozen wire DTOs, a concrete SQLite store with a seed-once
4	//! synthetic inbox, durable receipts with request-key dedup, a single serial
5	//! cancellable archive worker, an injectable clock, an OS-backed profile
6	//! lock, and change subscription. No Tauri, no OAuth, no network, no mail
7	//! beyond the synthetic fixture account. See `docs/vertical-slice-01.md`.
